      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕、毕竟！\n西沙里奥也好……救主同学也好，\n以及心心同学也都……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7d589c53fdbcfefc504bd0ca9b103d0bda4209ceb96a8df69b5d6d6034b9b0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
