      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你以为我会一直受着伤吗？\n真遗憾啊。\n……我已经做好重返赛场的准备了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7062b4c1601c18f9a4d63d622c804a47fd283c03279bb5418da2a0294d7e48",
