      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以说……快起来。睁开眼睛。\n……快跑起来，莱茵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "976e76d0aa5973f2139fc4bd11f9e52b203dec210c052f1711899d943fd771cf",
