      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你不是要让我们看着你的背影吗？\n……你不是要让我们为之着迷，\n为之憧憬吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0ccbc9da301c5c2c3266155a0383ef8ca5c775418a52c2cd882d509a8777d4",
