      "uid": "zhcn:b588a61e7c260c6ac7f95b19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在场的大家。\n后冠路线的赛马娘们——\n都和莱茵力量握着手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8717203a0c9fa67e0a4d78a2f962ca171865283934ea036dfe3371056442e1",
