      "uid": "zhcn:f9b39a7ae28eabcb4e2b1a35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "点燃了我们热情的是你吧？\n你可要负责到底啊！\n……拜托了，莱茵。",
